  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "PYTHON程式",
    "sub_ename": "PYTHON PROGRAM",
    "describe_ch": "Python係直譯式的跨平台電腦程式語言，它包含了一組功能完備的標準庫和豐富套件生態系，可以完成很多常見的任務（例如：讀寫檔案、自然語言處理、 網站開發、機器學習等），它的語法簡單，許多開發者推薦 Python 為初學者第一個學習的程式語言。課程內容包括程式邏輯概念、程式語法、及應用介紹。",
    "describe_eh": "Python is an object-oriented program language. It is composed of a full standard program library. It could be easily used to complete ordinary jobs. For example data input-output, friendly language processing、network development、machine-learning etc. Its program language is simple, Python is suggested for the first program language for beginners. The content of the course includes Logical introduction, programming language, and its applications.",
